  "description": "Token bucket rate limiter inspired by Resilience4j RateLimiter. Controls request frequency to protect API quotas (Tomorrow.io, Anthropic, government registries) and prevent thundering herd problems. Supports configurable limits per time window, burst allowance, and queue-based waiting. Integrates with observability for tracking request rates, rejections, and quota utilization. Critical for the Nyuchi 7-layer architecture where multiple data sources have different rate limits.",
